			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Index known ores and let the walker skip reachable waypoints by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/2\n* Add combat macro, auto sell, active hours and a panic key by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/3\n* Add Glacite commissions, excavator, visitors, slayer auto-start, Forge claim and route waypoint options by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/4\n* Prepare the 2.1.0 release by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/5\n* Market tools, skill tracker, farm builder, safe paths and profiles by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/6\n* Faster pathfinder, etherwarp / Instant Transmission travel, SkyHanni-style helpers by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/7\n* Message your alt account when a failsafe catches a macro check by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/8\n* Wynncraft support: server check, action-bar reader and Wynn Combat macro by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/9\n* Walker: steer with W/A/S/D from the camera's real facing by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/12\n* Pathfinder speed/falls/gaps/ladders/water + walker steering from the camera by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/10\n* Rotations: emulate a hand on a mouse pad by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/11\n* Add a loader that auto-updates the macro from GitHub releases by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/13\n* Loader: load the newest macro jar, not a stale one by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/14\n* Pathing and rotations: replan while walking, sprint-jumps, unstick, path trace, hand habits by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/15\n* Add userscripts: JavaScript macros loaded from the config folder by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/17\n* Rework updates to work like V5Loader: one self-updating jar by @Shoobie-code in https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/pull/18\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Shoobie-code/asdwajudja/compare/build-latest...2.1.0-r1"
		},
